        "mentions": [
          "loc_san_cha_mountain",
          "char_tie_ruo_nan",
          "gu_golden_needle_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Golden needle Gu by itself is not wondrous. Chaotic mind Gu sits in the same pairing list as poison liquid Gu, stiff Gu, and vitality Gu. When she shoots golden needle Gu into the surrounding apes, some stand frozen, some die from poison, and some are driven into a frenzy and attack nearby companions. The pairing that produces that ally-enemy confusion is chaotic mind Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          374
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
